3. Linguistics Collection: An exploration into the perception and construction of the word "crone" by reconfiguring and creating new word associations based on popular phrases, metaphors, and proverbs. This work aims to reveal the negative perception through which society views older women and how older women are often pigeonholed into two categories: cruel crone or a gentile granny.\
